{"id":"unverzu_glich","lemma":"unverzüglich","pos":"adv","rank":4401,"glosses":["immediately"],"ipa":"/ˈʊnfɛɐ̯t͡syːklɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/De-unverz%C3%BCglich.ogg/De-unverz%C3%BCglich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich werde es unverzüglich tun.","en":"I'll do it immediately.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Geh unverzüglich zum Arzt!","en":"Go to see a doctor immediately.","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"doctor, physician"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen uns unverzüglich darum kümmern.","en":"We need to take care of this immediately.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,{"g":"around it, around that"},{"g":"to take care"}]},{"text":"Wir haben ihn unverzüglich ins Krankenhaus gebracht.","en":"We took him to the hospital right away.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"into the"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"brought, carried"}]},{"text":"Schicken Sie bitte unverzüglich Unterstützung!","en":"Please send help right away.","words":[{"g":"to send, to dispatch"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"support"}]}]}